---
import PrivacyLayout from '@/layouts/PrivacyLayout.astro';
---

<PrivacyLayout
  title="Privacy Policy for AquaPact"
  description="Privacy Policy for AquaPact water intake tracker app"
  appName="AquaPact"
  lang="en"
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="text-sm">Last updated: February 12, 2025</p>
  <p>
    AquaPact ("we", "our", "us") is a water intake tracker app
    designed to help you manage your daily hydration goals. This
    Privacy Policy explains how we handle your data when you use
    AquaPact.
  </p>
  <h2>
    Data Collection and Usage
  </h2>
  <p>
    AquaPact does not require user authentication and does not
    collect any personal information. All data related to your water
    intake, wakeup and sleep times, daily hydration goals,
    notifications, daily records, and last seven days stats are
    stored locally on your device.
  </p>
  <h3>
    Local Data Storage
  </h3>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <p>
        <strong>Wakeup and Sleep Times:</strong>
        &nbsp;Configured wakeup and sleep times are stored locally
        on your device to help manage your hydration schedule.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        <strong>Daily Hydration Goal:</strong>
        &nbsp;Your daily target hydration goal is stored locally to
        track your progress.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        <strong>Notifications:</strong>
        &nbsp;Configured notification times are stored locally to
        remind you to drink water.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        <strong>Daily Records:</strong>
        &nbsp;Your daily water intake records are stored locally to
        provide you with accurate tracking.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        <strong>Last Seven Days Stats:</strong>
        &nbsp;Statistics for the last seven days are stored locally
        to help you monitor your hydration trends.
      </p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        <strong>New Feature:</strong>
        &nbsp;Future updates may include additional features to
        enhance user experience.
      </p>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>
    Data Sharing
  </h2>
  <p>
    AquaPact does not share your data with any third parties. All
    data remains on your device and is not transmitted to any
    external servers or services.
  </p>
  <h2>
    Data Security
  </h2>
  <p>
    We prioritize the security of your data. Since all data is
    stored locally on your device, it is protected by your device's
    security measures. We recommend using a secure password or
    biometric authentication to protect your device.
  </p>
  <h2>
    Changes to This Privacy Policy
  </h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes
    will be posted within the app, and we encourage you to review
    this policy periodically.
  </p>
  <h2>
    Contact Us
  </h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy,
    please contact us at miche.atucha@gmail.com
  </p>
  <p>
    By using AquaPact, you agree to the terms of this Privacy
    Policy.
  </p>
</PrivacyLayout>
